From 185d27fba61cbcc56d3d65a246dd20bdd229ef09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 08:31:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v2.0.1: fix link -- keep is_account_bound() when
 ACCOUNT_BINDING off

Dropping RTCONFIG_ACCOUNT_BINDING (prev commit) removed the only function that
guard defined -- is_account_bound() in shared/misc.c -- but it is called from
UNGATED code (rc/services.c ddns paths, rc/asus_ddns.c, inadyn/asuscommv2.c,
uploader/uploader.c, and the stale conn_diag-sql.o still in libconn_diag.so's
link line), so the userspace rc link failed:
    libconn_diag.so: undefined reference to `is_account_bound'

Tree-wide scan confirms is_account_bound() is the ONLY function defined under an
ACCOUNT_BINDING guard, so unguarding just this leaf resolves every caller.
Change: shared/misc.c + shared/shared.h now compile is_account_bound()
unconditionally. Semantics are unchanged and correct for the de-cloud build --
the account-binding registration/oauth code stays compiled out (config flag off),
so oauth_* nvram is never set and is_account_bound() always returns 0 ("never
bound"), which is exactly what the ungated ddns callers should see.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/shared/misc.c   | 2 +-
 release/src/router/shared/shared.h | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/shared/misc.c b/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
index 9ab1f0568d..1c97865913 100644
--- a/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
+++ b/release/src/router/shared/misc.c
@@ -7434,7 +7434,7 @@ int vpnc_use_tunnel(int vpnc_unit, const char* proto)
 }
 #endif
 
-#if defined(RTCONFIG_ACCOUNT_BINDING)
+#if 1 /* Reaper de-cloud: is_account_bound always defined (ungated ddns/conn_diag/uploader callers); returns 0 when ACCOUNT_BINDING off */
 int is_account_bound()
 {
 	if (nvram_match("oauth_auth_status", "2") &&
diff --git a/release/src/router/shared/shared.h b/release/src/router/shared/shared.h
index e9eb4518d8..389feb1c04 100644
--- a/release/src/router/shared/shared.h
+++ b/release/src/router/shared/shared.h
@@ -5772,7 +5772,7 @@ struct ads_info {
 };
 #endif
 
-#if defined(RTCONFIG_ACCOUNT_BINDING)
+#if 1 /* Reaper de-cloud: is_account_bound always defined (ungated ddns/conn_diag/uploader callers); returns 0 when ACCOUNT_BINDING off */
 extern int is_account_bound();
 #endif
 
-- 
2.25.1

